es me a wider view of what it takes to deliver a product.</p></div><ol class=\"career-list\" id=\"chapter-list\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Full career\" data-reveal></ol></div>\n<div class=\"career-footer\"><p>Based in Seoul. Connecting the product interface to the systems and people behind it.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline\" data-dialog=\"resume\" data-focus-id=\"resume-information\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Read my résumé <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-focus-id=\"persistent-navigation\"><div class=\"footer-inner\"><p class=\"footer-note\">Frontend, backend, AI. Made with curiosity.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"motion-toggle\" id=\"motion-toggle\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-focus-id=\"motion-toggle\"><span class=\"motion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"motion-label\">Motion on</span></button></div></footer></div><div class=\"portrait-dock\" id=\"portrait-dock\" hidden><p class=\"portrait-aside\" id=\"portrait-dock-aside\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"dock-face\" id=\"portrait-dock-button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"portrait-dialog\" aria-label=\"Jérôme's reaction: neutral\"><span class=\"pf-face\" id=\"portrait-dock-face\"><img src=\"/assets/portrait/portrait-neutral.webp\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Jérôme, calm\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"dock-mute\" id=\"portrait-dock-mute\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mute me\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.5 3.5h11v7h-6l-3 2.5v-2.5h-2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path class=\"mute-slash\" d=\"M2 14.5 14 1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg></button></div><dialog id=\"portrait-dialog\" class=\"portrait-drawer\" aria-labelledby=\"pd-title\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Living portrait · gpt-6-luna</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-button\" id=\"pd-close\" aria-label=\"Close\">×</button></div><div class=\"pd-body\"><header class=\"pd-head\"><span class=\"pd-thumb\"><img id=\"pd-face\" src=\"/assets/portrait/portrait-neutral.webp\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Jérôme, calm\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div><h2 id=\"pd-title\">Why this face?</h2><p class=\"pd-trigger\" id=\"pd-trigger\"></p><p class=\"pd-sent\" id=\"pd-sent\"></p></div></header><p class=\"pd-quote\" id=\"pd-quote\" hidden></p><p class=\"pd-fallback\" id=\"pd-fallback\" hidden></p><section aria-labelledby=\"pd-q-title\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"pd-q-title\">Four questions, one Decisions request</h3><!-- Question names and instructions mirror buildRequest() in lib/portrait-decision.mjs. --><ol class=\"pd-questions\"><li><p class=\"pd-qhead\"><code>should_react</code><span class=\"pd-type\">predicate</span></p><p class=\"pd-ask\">Is this a moment where the portrait should visibly react, rather than stay as it is?</p><div class=\"pd-answer\" id=\"pd-a-should_react\"></div></li><li><p class=\"pd-qhead\"><code>expression</code><span class=\"pd-type\">choice</span></p><p class=\"pd-ask\">Which facial expression best fits Jérôme's feeling about this moment?</p><div class=\"pd-answer\" id=\"pd-a-expression\"></div></li><li><p class=\"pd-qhead\"><code>aside</code><span class=\"pd-type\">choice</span></p><p class=\"pd-ask\">Which short aside, if any, fits this moment best? Choose none to say nothing.</p><div class=\"pd-answer\" id=\"pd-a-aside\"></div></li><li><p class=\"pd-qhead\"><code>intensity</code><span class=\"pd-type\">score</span></p><p class=\"pd-ask\">How strongly should the portrait react?</p><div class=\"pd-answer\" id=\"pd-a-intensity\"></div></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby=\"pd-r-title\"><h3 class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"pd-r-title\">Readout</h3><dl class=\"pd-stats\"><di